welcome to cloud built a highly  challenging game where you will master  high speeds and perform precision  platforming while taking out enemies in  your path as you learn to master these  mechanics you will begin to see your  surroundings with new life  with full control of your characters  movements the environment can really be  used to your advantage  you can run or climb on almost any  surface and by scouting the environment  you can find different ways to approach  each challenge  in cloudbuilt you can use abilities like  jumping and dashing at any time whether  you were on the ground in the air or on  a wall  other abilities require you to make use  of the environment such as sliding in  slopes and running on walls  but you are always in full control while  using them you can land anywhere on a  wall to start a wall run then use your  boosters to shift you up and down  avoiding threats  of course it's not only the environment  that stands between you and the goal  enemies will try to take you out but you  can always engage them with a blast from  your gun whether you're in the air  running on a wall or hanging from a  Ledge  Kyle built is currently in steam  greenlight process help us make this  game available on Steam by heading over  to our greenlight page and giving  cloudbuilt your vote please keep in mind  with everything you see here is a  work-in-progress and does not represent  the final quality of the game
 

